<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1217"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nostone<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nostone<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, October 14, 2004 - 12:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Can anyone point me in the direction of these puzzles?  Was it posted on this site?  I saw the one on the news page, but it doesn&#39;t seem like the same one everyone else is talking about.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
